# Ctrl+Alt+Del resets the machine through the 8042: the BIOS starts again,
# and so does rx286.
define: TEST_KEYBOARD
keys: {ctrl-alt-del}
match: prefix
# DOSBox-X keeps protected-mode segment limits across the 8042's reset (docs/emulators.md).
emulators: bochs mame
---
rx286, test build
rx286: Ctrl+Alt+Del: resetting
rx286, test build
